PN,16303
SC,0003
CT,20,T
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F163A1786375107
OL,1,Wj5hw1~{4k7juhw1{$             G3/3
OL,2,W+.-'"-$/*%*%*%/"-$/*%Q,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GUK long range forecast
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Tue 25 Aug to Tue 8 Sep
OL,6,FHigh pressure will probably be
OL,7,Fdominant in the vicinity of the UK
OL,8,Fduring this period, meaning periods of
OL,9,Fdry weather for many regions. However,
OL,10,Fsome more unsettled or changeable
OL,11,Finterludes are probable at times,
OL,12,Fbringing showers or some longer spells
OL,13,Fof rain, although overall rainfall
OL,14,Famounts are more likely to be below
OL,15,Faverage than above. Temperatures will
OL,16,Flikely be above average and some
OL,17,Fspells of hot weather and heatwaves
OL,18,Fare possible, especially in the south.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
